       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
      ******************************************************************
      *           I D E N T I F I C A T I O N   D I V I S I O N        *
      ******************************************************************
      * PROGRAM NAME
      ******************************************************************
       PROGRAM-ID. SWB4809.
      ******************************************************************
      *                                                                *
      *                      - MENSAGENS SWIFT -                       *
      *                                                                *
      ******************************************************************
      * RECONCILIAÇÃO AUTOMÁTICA DE EXTRACTOS (INICIALIZACAO)          *
      ******************************************************************
      *           L O G     D E     A L T E R A C O E S                *
      ******************************************************************
      *  INICIO  * AUTOR  * FIM    *  C O M E N T A R I O S            *
      *          *        *        *                                   *
      *          *        *        *                                   *
      ******************************************************************
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
      ******************************************************************
      *           E N V I R O N M E N T         D I V I S I O N        *
      ******************************************************************
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
      ******************************************************************
      *                     CONFIGURATION SECTION                      *
      ******************************************************************
       SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER. IBM-AS400.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.
           DECIMAL-POINT IS COMMA.
      ******************************************************************
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
      ******************************************************************
      *                      INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION                      *
      ******************************************************************
       FILE-CONTROL.
      ******************************************************************
       DATA DIVISION.
      ******************************************************************
      *                   D A T A   D I V I S I O N                    *
      ******************************************************************
       FILE SECTION.
      ******************************************************************
      *                          FILE SECTION                          *
      ******************************************************************
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
      ******************************************************************
      *                    WORKING STORAGE SECTION                     *
      ******************************************************************
       01  FILLER                          PIC X(40) VALUE
                                               'INICIO WORKING-STORAGE'.

      ******************************************************************
      * PROGRAM CONTROL
      ******************************************************************
       01  WS-PROGRAM-CONTROL.
           05 WS-PROGNAME                  PIC  X(10) VALUE 'SWB4809'.

      ******************************************************************
      * TABELAS
      ******************************************************************
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SWCD5606  END-EXEC.
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SWCD5808  END-EXEC.
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SWCDPARAM END-EXEC.
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SWCD7204  END-EXEC.
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SWCD8201  END-EXEC.

      ******************************************************************
      * APIS
      ******************************************************************
           COPY AQCK0001.
           COPY AQCW0109.
           COPY VIAW0011.

      ******************************************************************
      * APIS
      ******************************************************************
           COPY SXCL0002.
           COPY SXCL0445.
           COPY ETCL1000.
           COPY ETCL9203.

      ******************************************************************
      * CONSTANTES
      ******************************************************************
       01  WS-CONSTANTES.
           05 CON-SWVT5606                 PIC  X(08) VALUE 'SWVT5606'.
           05 CON-SWVT5808                 PIC  X(08) VALUE 'SWVT5808'.
           05 CON-SWVT7204                 PIC  X(08) VALUE 'SWVT7204'.
           05 CON-SWVT8201                 PIC  X(08) VALUE 'SWVT8201'.
           05 CON-PEND                     PIC  X(02) VALUE 'PD'.
           05 CON-RECONC                   PIC  X(02) VALUE 'RC'.
           05 CON-RECONC-PROP              PIC  X(02) VALUE 'RS'.
           05 CON-AUTOMATICA               PIC  X(01) VALUE 'A'.
           05 CON-MANUAL                   PIC  X(01) VALUE 'M'.
           05 CON-MT940                    PIC  X(05) VALUE 'MT940'.
           05 CON-MT950                    PIC  X(05) VALUE 'MT950'.
           05 CON-RC                       PIC  X(02) VALUE 'RC'.
           05 CON-RS                       PIC  X(02) VALUE 'RS'.
           05 CON-A                        PIC  X(01) VALUE 'A'.
AG         05 CON-M                        PIC  X(01) VALUE 'M'.
AG         05 CON-P                        PIC  X(01) VALUE 'P'.
           05 CON-O00                      PIC  X(03) VALUE 'O00'.
           05 CON-SWPARAM                  PIC  X(08) VALUE 'SWPARAM '.
           05 CON-DATA-MIN                 PIC  9(08) VALUE 00010101.
           05 CON-DATA-MAX                 PIC  9(08) VALUE 99991231.

      ******************************************************************
      * VARIAVEIS
      ******************************************************************
       01 WS-VARIAVEIS.
           05 WS-COUNT                     PIC S9(10).
           05 WS-TOPREC                    PIC S9(03) COMP-3.
           05 WS-TEXREC                    PIC S9(03) COMP-3.
           05 WS-TOPPEND                   PIC S9(03) COMP-3.
           05 WS-TEXPEND                   PIC S9(03) COMP-3.
           05 WS-CREFOPR-2                 PIC  X(16).
           05 WS-CNIVREC                   PIC  X(03).
           05 FILLER REDEFINES WS-CNIVREC.
             10 WS-CTIPOREC                PIC  X(01).
             10 WS-CFASEREC                PIC  X(01).
             10 WS-CNIVLREC                PIC  X(01).
           05 WS-CNIVREC-ANT               PIC  X(03).
           05 WS-DATVAL-MIN                PIC S9(08) COMP-3.

      ******************************************************************
      * SWITCHES
      ******************************************************************
       01  WS-SWITCHES.
           05 WS-CURSOR-STATE              PIC S9(03) COMP-3.
              88 WS-CURSOR-OK                         VALUE ZEROES.
              88 WS-CURSOR-END                        VALUE -1.
           05 WS-RECONC-STATE              PIC S9(03) COMP-3.
              88 WS-RECONC-OPER-NAO                   VALUE ZEROES.
              88 WS-RECONC-OPER                       VALUE -1.

           05 SW-FASE-2                    PIC  X(01).
              88 SW-FASE-2-OK                         VALUE 'S'.
              88 SW-FASE-2-NOK                        VALUE 'N'.

      ******************************************************************
      * COPYS
      ******************************************************************
           COPY VIAW0030.
           COPY VIAL0015.

      *    COPY AQCW0009.
           COPY AQCW0011.

           COPY SWCK0001.
           COPY SWCK0002.
           COPY VIAL0001.

      ******************************************************************
      * DB2
      ******************************************************************
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SQLCA    END-EXEC.

      ******************************************************************
       01  FILLER                          PIC X(40) VALUE
                                               'FIM DA WORKING-STORAGE'.

      ******************************************************************
       LINKAGE SECTION.
           COPY AQCW0009.

      ******************************************************************
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING AQCW0009-DATA.

      ******************************************************************
      *              P R O C E D U R E   D I V I S I O N               *
      ******************************************************************
       0000-MAINLINE.
      ******************************************************************
           MOVE '0000-MAINLINE    '        TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
           IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           PERFORM 1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA
              THRU 1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA-EXIT.

           IF AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2000-PROC-PROGRAMA
                 THRU 2000-PROC-PROGRAMA-EXIT
           END-IF.

           PERFORM 3000-FIM-PROGRAMA
              THRU 3000-FIM-PROGRAMA-EXIT.

       0000-MAINLINE-EXIT.
           GOBACK.

      ******************************************************************
       1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA.
      ******************************************************************
           MOVE '1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA'     TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
           IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           INITIALIZE WS-VARIAVEIS.
           INITIALIZE WS-SWITCHES.

           MOVE CON-DATA-MAX               TO WS-DATVAL-MIN.
           MOVE ZEROES                     TO WS-COUNT.

           SET AQCW0009-RCODE-OK           TO TRUE.

           IF AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM AQCP0100-REG-INICIO
                 THRU AQCP0100-REG-INICIO-EXIT
           END-IF.

           IF AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM AQCP0100-OBT-DADOS-ARQ
                 THRU AQCP0100-OBT-DADOS-ARQ-EXIT
           END-IF.

           IF AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2000-INI-LIMPA-DADOS
                 THRU 2000-INI-LIMPA-DADOS-EXIT
           END-IF.

       1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      ******************************************************************
       2000-PROC-PROGRAMA.
      ******************************************************************
           MOVE '2000-PROC-PROGRAMA'       TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
           IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

       2000-PROC-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      ******************************************************************
       2000-INI-LIMPA-DADOS.
      ******************************************************************
           MOVE '2000-INI-LIMPA-DADOS'     TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
           IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE 'SW'                       TO SWPARAM-PRCODPAR.
           MOVE 'EXESWB4809'               TO SWPARAM-PRPARAM.

           EXEC SQL
               SELECT PRVALALF
                    , PRVALDAT
                 INTO :SWPARAM-PRVALALF
                    , :SWPARAM-PRVALDAT
                 FROM SWPARAM
                WHERE PRCODPAR = :SWPARAM-PRCODPAR
                  AND PRPARAM  = :SWPARAM-PRPARAM
                 WITH UR
           END-EXEC.

           MOVE CON-SWPARAM                TO AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.

           EVALUATE TRUE
            WHEN AQCW0011-OK
              MOVE SWPARAM-PRVALDAT        TO WS-DATVAL-MIN
              IF SWPARAM-PRVALALF = 'R'
                 PERFORM 2000-UPDATE56
                    THRU 2000-UPDATE56-EXIT
                 PERFORM 2000-UPDATE58
                    THRU 2000-UPDATE58-EXIT
                 PERFORM 2000-UPDATE72
                    THRU 2000-UPDATE72-EXIT
                 PERFORM 2000-DELETE82
                    THRU 2000-DELETE82-EXIT
              END-IF

            WHEN OTHER
              SET  AQCW0009-RCODE-APL      TO TRUE
              SET  VIAW0030-DB2-ERROR      TO TRUE
              MOVE '1300-OBTEM-PARAM-EXEC' TO VIAW0030-PARAGRAPH-NAME
              MOVE AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME     TO VIAW0030-TABLE-NAME
              MOVE AQCW0011-SQLCODE        TO VIAW0030-SQLCODE
              MOVE 'ERRO SELECT  DA TABELA SWPARAM'
                                           TO VIAW0030-DESC1
              PERFORM VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL
                 THRU VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL-EXIT
           END-EVALUATE.

       2000-INI-LIMPA-DADOS-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      ******************************************************************
       2000-UPDATE56.
      ******************************************************************
           MOVE '2000-UPDATE56       '     TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
           IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE CON-PEND
             TO SWCD5606-CCODEST
AG    *    MOVE SPACES
AG         MOVE CON-P
             TO SWCD5606-CTIPREC
           MOVE SPACES
             TO SWCD5606-MOTIVO
           MOVE SPACES
             TO SWCD5606-OBSER
           MOVE SPACES
             TO SWCD5606-CSENDREC
           MOVE ZEROES
             TO SWCD5606-MVLRREC
           MOVE SPACES
             TO SWCD5606-CMOEDREC
AG         MOVE ZEROES
             TO SWCD5606-DTVCREC
AG         MOVE ZEROES
             TO SWCD5606-DATREC
           MOVE SPACES
             TO SWCD5606-CREFREC
           MOVE ZEROES
             TO SWCD5606-NOPRREC
           MOVE SPACES
             TO SWCD5606-COSNREC
           MOVE SPACES
             TO SWCD5606-COSNCREC
           MOVE CON-O00
             TO SWCD5606-CNIVREC
           MOVE WS-PROGNAME
             TO SWCD5606-CUSERID
           MOVE ZEROS
             TO SWCD5606-IDRECONC
           MOVE SPACES
             TO SWCD5606-CNATREC

           EXEC SQL
                UPDATE SWVT5606
                   SET NOPRREC  = :SWCD5606-NOPRREC
                     , CCODEST  = :SWCD5606-CCODEST
                     , CREFREC  = :SWCD5606-CREFREC
                     , DATREC   = :SWCD5606-DATREC
                     , CTIPREC  = :SWCD5606-CTIPREC
                     , MOTIVO   = :SWCD5606-MOTIVO
                     , OBSER    = :SWCD5606-OBSER
                     , CSENDREC = :SWCD5606-CSENDREC
                     , MVLRREC  = :SWCD5606-MVLRREC
                     , CMOEDREC = :SWCD5606-CMOEDREC
                     , DTVCREC  = :SWCD5606-DTVCREC
                     , CNIVREC  = :SWCD5606-CNIVREC
                     , COSNREC  = :SWCD5606-COSNREC
                     , COSNCREC = :SWCD5606-COSNCREC
                     , CUSERID  = :SWCD5606-CUSERID
                     , HTIMEST  = CURRENT TIMESTAMP
                     , IDRECONC = :SWCD5606-IDRECONC
                     , CNATREC  = :SWCD5606-CNATREC
                 WHERE CCODEST <> :CON-PEND
                   AND DATL    >= :SWPARAM-PRVALDAT
           END-EXEC

           MOVE CON-SWVT5606               TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.
           EVALUATE TRUE
           WHEN AQCW0011-OK
           WHEN AQCW0011-NOTFND
                CONTINUE
           WHEN OTHER
                SET  AQCW0009-RCODE-APL     TO TRUE
                SET  VIAW0030-DB2-ERROR     TO TRUE
                MOVE '1000-UPDATE56        ' TO VIAW0030-PARAGRAPH-NAME
                MOVE AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME    TO VIAW0030-TABLE-NAME
                MOVE AQCW0011-SQLCODE       TO VIAW0030-SQLCODE
                MOVE 'ERRO UPDATE  DA TABELA 56     '
                                            TO VIAW0030-DESC1
                PERFORM VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL
                   THRU VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL-EXIT
           END-EVALUATE.

       2000-UPDATE56-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      ******************************************************************
       2000-UPDATE58.
      ******************************************************************
           MOVE '2000-UPDATE58       '     TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
           IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE CON-PEND                   TO SWCD5808-CCODEST.
           MOVE CON-DATA-MIN               TO SWCD5808-DATREC.
           MOVE CON-P                      TO SWCD5808-CTIPREC.
PML24 *    MOVE ZEROES                     TO SWCD5808-NOPRREC.
PML24 *    MOVE SPACES                     TO SWCD5808-MOTIVO.
PML24 *    MOVE SPACES                     TO SWCD5808-OBSER.
PML24 *    MOVE SPACES                     TO SWCD5808-CBYPASS.
PML24 *    MOVE SPACES                     TO SWCD5808-CSENDREC.
PML24 *    MOVE SPACES                     TO SWCD5808-CMOEDREC.
PML24 *    MOVE ZEROES                     TO SWCD5808-MVLRREC.
PML24 *    MOVE SPACES                     TO SWCD5808-CROPRREC.
PML24 *    MOVE SPACES                     TO SWCD5808-CORIGEMREC.
           MOVE CON-O00                    TO SWCD5808-CNIVREC.
           MOVE WS-PROGNAME                TO SWCD5808-CUSERID.
PML24 *    MOVE ZEROS                      TO SWCD5808-NORDREC.
           MOVE ZEROS                      TO SWCD5808-IDRECONC.
           MOVE SPACES                     TO SWCD5808-CNATREC.

           EXEC SQL
              UPDATE SWVT5808
                 SET CCODEST    = :SWCD5808-CCODEST
                   , DATREC     = :SWCD5808-DATREC
                   , CTIPREC    = :SWCD5808-CTIPREC
PML24 *            , NOPRREC    = :SWCD5808-NOPRREC
PML24 *            , MOTIVO     = :SWCD5808-MOTIVO
PML24 *            , OBSER      = :SWCD5808-OBSER
PML24 *            , CBYPASS    = :SWCD5808-CBYPASS
PML24 *            , CSENDREC   = :SWCD5808-CSENDREC
PML24 *            , CMOEDREC   = :SWCD5808-CMOEDREC
PML24 *            , MVLRREC    = :SWCD5808-MVLRREC
PML24 *            , CROPRREC   = :SWCD5808-CROPRREC
PML24 *            , CORIGEMREC = :SWCD5808-CORIGEMREC
                   , CNIVREC    = :SWCD5808-CNIVREC
                   , CUSERID    = :SWCD5808-CUSERID
                   , HTIMEST    = CURRENT TIMESTAMP
PML24 *            , NORDREC    = :SWCD5808-NORDREC
                   , IDRECONC   = :SWCD5808-IDRECONC
                   , CNATREC    = :SWCD5808-CNATREC
               WHERE CCODEST   <> :CON-PEND
                 AND DATVAL    >= :WS-DATVAL-MIN
           END-EXEC

           MOVE CON-SWVT5808               TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.

           EVALUATE TRUE
           WHEN AQCW0011-OK
           WHEN AQCW0011-NOTFND
                CONTINUE
           WHEN OTHER
                SET  AQCW0009-RCODE-APL     TO TRUE
                SET  VIAW0030-DB2-ERROR     TO TRUE
                MOVE '2000-UPDATE58       ' TO VIAW0030-PARAGRAPH-NAME
                MOVE AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME    TO VIAW0030-TABLE-NAME
                MOVE AQCW0011-SQLCODE       TO VIAW0030-SQLCODE
                MOVE 'ERRO UPDATE  DA TABELA 58     '
                                            TO VIAW0030-DESC1
                PERFORM VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL
                   THRU VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL-EXIT
           END-EVALUATE.

       2000-UPDATE58-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      ******************************************************************
       2000-UPDATE72.
      ******************************************************************
           MOVE '2000-UPDATE72       '     TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
           IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE SPACES                     TO SWCD7204-IRECONC.
           MOVE CON-P                      TO SWCD7204-CTIPREC.
           MOVE CON-PEND                   TO SWCD7204-CCODEST.
           MOVE ZEROS                      TO SWCD7204-IDRECONC.
           MOVE SPACES                     TO SWCD7204-CNATREC.
           MOVE WS-PROGNAME                TO SWCD7204-CUSERID.
           MOVE CON-O00                    TO SWCD7204-CNIVREC.


PML24 *    MOVE SPACES                     TO SWCD7204-COSN.
PML24 *    MOVE SPACES                     TO SWCD7204-COSNC.
PML24 *    MOVE SPACES                     TO SWCD7204-CREF.
PML24 *    MOVE SPACES                     TO SWCD7204-CREFOPR.
PML24 *    MOVE SPACES                     TO SWCD7204-CCODMSG.
PML24 *    MOVE ZEROES                     TO SWCD7204-DATVAL.
PML24 *    MOVE SPACES                     TO SWCD7204-GOBS.

      **R  MOVE SPACES                     TO SWCD7204-MOTIVO.
      **R  MOVE SPACES                     TO SWCD7204-OBSER.
      **R  MOVE SPACES                     TO SWCD7204-CBYPASS.
      **R  MOVE SPACES                     TO SWCD7204-CSENDREC.
      **R  MOVE SPACES                     TO SWCD7204-CMOEDREC.
      **R  MOVE ZEROES                     TO SWCD7204-MVLRREC.
      **R  MOVE 00010101                   TO SWCD7204-DATREC.
      **R  MOVE SPACES                     TO SWCD7204-CROPRREC.
      **R  MOVE ZEROES                     TO SWCD7204-NOPRREC.
      **R  MOVE SPACES                     TO SWCD7204-CORIGEMREC.

           EXEC SQL
              UPDATE SWVT7204
                 SET IRECONC  = :SWCD7204-IRECONC
                   , CTIPREC  = :SWCD7204-CTIPREC
                   , CUSERID  = :SWCD7204-CUSERID
                   , HTIMEST  = CURRENT TIMESTAMP
                   , CCODEST  = :SWCD7204-CCODEST
                   , IDRECONC = :SWCD7204-IDRECONC
                   , CNATREC  = :SWCD7204-CNATREC
                   , CNIVREC  = :SWCD7204-CNIVREC

PML24 *            , COSN     = :SWCD7204-COSN
PML24 *            , COSNC    = :SWCD7204-COSNC
PML24 *            , CREF     = :SWCD7204-CREF
PML24 *            , CREFOPR  = :SWCD7204-CREFOPR
PML24 *            , CCODMSG  = :SWCD7204-CCODMSG
PML24 *            , DATVAL   = :SWCD7204-DATVAL
PML24 *            , GOBS     = :SWCD7204-GOBS

               WHERE CCODEST <> :CON-PEND
                 AND MRDATL  >= :WS-DATVAL-MIN
           END-EXEC

           MOVE CON-SWVT7204               TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.

           EVALUATE TRUE
           WHEN AQCW0011-OK
           WHEN AQCW0011-NOTFND
                CONTINUE
           WHEN OTHER
                SET  AQCW0009-RCODE-APL     TO TRUE
                SET  VIAW0030-DB2-ERROR     TO TRUE
                MOVE '2000-UPDATE72       ' TO VIAW0030-PARAGRAPH-NAME
                MOVE AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME    TO VIAW0030-TABLE-NAME
                MOVE AQCW0011-SQLCODE       TO VIAW0030-SQLCODE
                MOVE 'ERRO UPDATE  DA TABELA 72     '
                                            TO VIAW0030-DESC1
                PERFORM VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL
                   THRU VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL-EXIT
           END-EVALUATE.

       2000-UPDATE72-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      ******************************************************************
       2000-DELETE82.
      ******************************************************************
           MOVE '2000-DELETE82       '     TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
           IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           EXEC SQL
              DELETE
                FROM SWVT8201
               WHERE 1 = 1
           END-EXEC

           MOVE CON-SWVT8201               TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.

           EVALUATE TRUE
           WHEN AQCW0011-OK
           WHEN AQCW0011-NOTFND
                CONTINUE
           WHEN OTHER
                SET  AQCW0009-RCODE-APL     TO TRUE
                SET  VIAW0030-DB2-ERROR     TO TRUE
                MOVE '2000-UPDATE58       ' TO VIAW0030-PARAGRAPH-NAME
                MOVE AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME    TO VIAW0030-TABLE-NAME
                MOVE AQCW0011-SQLCODE       TO VIAW0030-SQLCODE
                MOVE 'ERRO DELETE  DA TABELA 82     '
                                            TO VIAW0030-DESC1
                PERFORM VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL
                   THRU VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL-EXIT
           END-EVALUATE.

       2000-DELETE82-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      ******************************************************************
       3000-FIM-PROGRAMA.
      ******************************************************************
           MOVE '3000-FIM-PROGRAMA'        TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
           IF VIAL0015-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           IF AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM AQCP0100-REG-FIM
                 THRU AQCP0100-REG-FIM-EXIT
           END-IF.

           PERFORM AQCP0002-TRATA-SYNCPOINT
              THRU AQCP0002-TRATA-SYNCPOINT-EXIT.

       3000-FIM-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      ******************************************************************
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE AQCP0002 END-EXEC.
      ******************************************************************
           COPY VIAP0011.
           COPY VIAP0015.
           COPY VIAP0030.
           COPY AQCP0011.
           COPY AQCP0109.
           COPY ETCP1000.
           COPY ETCR9203.
